   "type": "markdown",
   "source": "# The Schrödinger Equation\nThe time-dependent Schrödinger equation governs how a quantum state evolves, alongside its time-independent eigenvalue form."
  },
  {
   "type": "latex",
   "source": "i\\hbar\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial t}\\Psi = -\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\nabla^2\\Psi + V\\Psi"
  },
  {
   "type": "latex",
   "source": "\\hat{H}\\psi = E\\psi"
  }
 ]
